# --- Lerobot vendored source: do NOT ignore its source/test packages named "datasets" ---
# The generic `datasets/` rule above is for data artifacts; these are Python source/tests
# that merely live in a dir called `datasets`. Binary test fixtures (*.safetensors) stay ignored.
!post_training/lerobot/src/lerobot/datasets/
!post_training/lerobot/src/lerobot/datasets/**
!post_training/lerobot/tests/datasets/
!post_training/lerobot/tests/datasets/**
!post_training/lerobot/tests/artifacts/datasets/
!post_training/lerobot/tests/artifacts/datasets/save_dataset_to_safetensors.py
